# Card images and archives. These are hundreds of megabytes to a gigabyte and
# are downloaded, not authored. docs/procedure.md says where to get them.
*.img
*.7z
*.xz
*.gz

# Card forensics: the first megabyte of a card and its partition table, taken
# before and after a write. Device-specific and worthless to anyone else.
pyra-card-*.bin
pyra-card-*.sfdisk

# Build output. The work tree lives outside the repository by default, but
# do not let an override of PYRA_BUILD_DIR drag 1.5 GB of kernel source in.
/build/
*.deb
*.ko
*.o

# Captures pulled off the device.
modeset-hang-*/
*-hang-*.log
dmesg-*.log
Xorg.*.log

# Workstation-local settings: device addresses, SSH key path, agent socket.
# Specific to one machine and one network. See the file's own header.
pyra-local.conf

# TI manuals (TRM, EVM reference guide). Copyrighted and export-controlled;
# kept locally for reference, never committed.
docs/*.pdf

# Private development notes are kept outside this repository. Keep stray copies out.
/TODO.md
/docs/progress.md
/docs/release-readiness.md
/docs/handoff/
